{%- comment -%}
  Zo Veilig — Overzicht. Read-only final-review step inserted between Winkelwagen and
  the Shopify checkout: Winkelwagen -> Overzicht (this page, /cart?view=overzicht) -> Afrekenen.
  Rendered via templates/cart.overzicht.json against the live {{ cart }} — no separate data
  source, so it always reflects exactly what will be charged.

  WHAT SHOPIFY COLLECTS (2026-09-23 model, CLAUDE.md Pricing pipeline): a package purchase
  is exactly two lines — the chosen installation product (qty 1, full price, never
  discounted) and the real package product at quantity zv_promo_package_qty (3: the first
  3 months, prepaid). Shopify's automatic "Eerste 3 maanden" discount (50%, scoped to the
  package products only) takes 50% off the package line by itself; nothing in this theme
  computes that discount. The monthly rate from month 4 is billed by Odoo over SEPA.

  PRICING: "Vandaag te betalen" and every row of its breakdown are read live from {{ cart }}
  (item.final_line_price, i.e. after Shopify's discount allocation), each row straight off
  the line item it describes, so the itemized list always adds up to what Shopify charges —
  never recomputed here. "Daarna … /mnd" is the package line's UNIT price before the
  discount (item.original_price), never unit x 3.

  PACKAGE IDENTITY: package-specific commercial terms (installation group, contract duration,
  indicative contract value, the breakdown label) are matched to the cart's package line —
  product type `sub_type` — through its `custom.finder_key` product metafield. If no package
  can be identified (e.g. a cart with only accessories), or if the cart holds more than one
  distinct package, the commercial-terms rows are hidden rather than showing one package's
  numbers as if they applied to both. Never a literal price or duration here regardless —
  CI check #10 in scripts/check_pricing.py enforces that.

  CHECKOUT GATE: the checkout button is disabled server-side, whatever zv-cart-guard does:
  - cart_needs_activation: a package without its installation line (Climax: the fixed CL003
    line, which zv-cart-guard adds; NAMI: one of the 3 options, which only the customer picks
    in the required radio group below);
  - cart_needs_fix: a package line at a quantity other than zv_promo_package_qty, a second
    line for the same package, an installation line (CL003 or a NAMI variant) at a quantity
    other than 1, the Climax installation line in a cart with no Climax package, a package
    line whose package doesn't offer Woning but carries a Woning property, or a rider line
    line out of step with the bought Videodeurbel (ADC-750) it rides with — zv-cart-guard
    corrects all of these and reloads;
  - cart_pkg_undiscounted: a package line that carries no discount at all (e.g. the Shopify
    discount was deactivated). The guard can't fix that, and a customer must never pay 3
    full months, so checkout stays blocked with a contact message instead;
  - cart_woning_bad (per Woning product that resolves: the NAMI packages' since
    2026-09-25, the Climax packages' since 2026-10-27): a Woning line's quantity isn't
    zv_promo_package_qty x the floors of its own platform's package lines (or it's split over
    several lines), it carries no discount, or its unit price isn't zv_woning_unit_cents. Same
    contact message: never overcharge for Woning.
  - cart_koop_bad (Huren/Kopen, 2026-10-24): a malformed Koop line (Afname: Kopen on a product
    that isn't a Koop product, or a Koop product without it; see snippets/zv-koop-fk.liquid) or a
    Koop line that carries a discount. The intro promo is Huren only; same contact message.
  KOOP LINES (docs/koop-checkout-2026-10-24.md): a bought package is a one-time line at
  quantity 1 (cart_needs_fix otherwise, zv-cart-guard resets it). It takes the installation step
  of its installGroup like a rented package (has_nami_pkg / has_climax_pkg), but it is never a
  package line for the promo, "Daarna", the contract term or the ICV. Woning on a bought
  package is its property only: shown on the line, never counted towards a Woning line.
  The gate reflects the cart at render time, so on click the button also re-reads /cart.js
  and reloads this page instead of navigating to /checkout when the cart no longer matches
  data-cart-sig or zv-cart-guard's rules (window.zvCartGuard.planFix) find a fix.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- include 'zv-pricing' -%}

{%- liquid
  assign sub_type = section.settings.sub_type | default: 'Beveiligingsabonnement'
  assign sub_tag = section.settings.sub_tag | default: 'abonnement'
  assign activation_variant_id = all_products[zv_activation_handle].selected_or_first_available_variant.id
  assign nami_install_geen_variant_id = all_products[zv_nami_install_geen_handle].selected_or_first_available_variant.id
  assign nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id = all_products[zv_nami_install_telefonisch_handle].selected_or_first_available_variant.id
  assign nami_install_huis_variant_id = all_products[zv_nami_install_huis_handle].selected_or_first_available_variant.id

  comment
    Videodeurbel/Afstandsbediening add-on lines (2026-09-26): resolved by handle only, never a
    hardcoded variant id or price. Used for the Huren/Kopen grouping and the itemized breakdown's
    row name below (zv-cart-row-name; both listings get the clean name itself via
    zv-install-name/zv_install_names_by_handle) — these two never take part in any checkout gate,
    unlike the package/installation/Woning lines above.
  endcomment
  assign zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id = all_products['huur-video-deurbel-750'].variants.first.id
  assign zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id = all_products['huur-afstandsbediening'].variants.first.id

  comment
    Ontzorgpakket (Inzicht since 2026-10-13; one product per package since 2026-10-27: MOIOH,
    MOZOH, MOAOH, OHC012 for Beschermd/Protect): same treatment as the two above for the
    breakdown row name. A confirmed recurring monthly service, so it also counts toward
    "Daarna" in the totals loop below. Handles from the generated zv-package-handles (line:
    'ontzorg'); zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list holds strings, so compare item.variant_id | append: ''.
  endcomment
  capture zv_ontzorg_handles
    render 'zv-package-handles', line: 'ontzorg', what: 'handles'
  endcapture
  assign zv_ontzorg_variant_ids = ''
  assign zv_ontzorg_handle_list = zv_ontzorg_handles | strip | split: '|'
  for h in zv_ontzorg_handle_list
    assign ov = all_products[h].variants.first.id
    if ov != blank
      assign zv_ontzorg_variant_ids = zv_ontzorg_variant_ids | append: '|' | append: ov
    endif
  endfor
  assign zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list = zv_ontzorg_variant_ids | remove_first: '|' | split: '|'

  comment
    Koop add-on lines (Huren/Kopen), synced at quantity 1 by syncAddonLines() on Oplossingen:
    Videodeurbel's Koop product ADC-750 and Afstandsbediening's CL004, both by handle (2026-10-27;
    no Koop setting for either any more). Labelled "<naam> (kopen)" below; one-off, never in
    "Daarna". 0 when unresolved, so it never matches a line.
  endcomment
  assign zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id = all_products['koop-video-deurbel-750'].variants.first.id | plus: 0
  assign zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id = all_products['koop-afstandsbediening'].variants.first.id | plus: 0

  comment
    Woning lines (2026-09-25; one per platform since 2026-10-27: one for the NAMI packages,
    one for the Climax packages): resolved by zv-woning-variants, by handle and only if the
    first variant's SKU is the config's. woning_variant_id_list is parallel to
    woning_applies_by_product_list (each product's package handles). An unresolved product is 0:
    its packages keep the property-only behaviour (no Woning row, no Woning gate for it).
    woning_line_log / woning_floor_log collect 'product index:quantity|' per Woning line and
    'product index:floors|' per package line, for the per-product gate below.
  endcomment
  capture woning_variant_ids
    render 'zv-woning-variants', handles: zv_woning_handles, skus: zv_woning_skus
  endcapture
  assign woning_variant_ids = woning_variant_ids | strip
  assign woning_variant_id_list = woning_variant_ids | split: '|'
  assign woning_applies_by_product_list = zv_woning_applies_by_product | split: '|'
  assign woning_applies_fks_by_product_list = zv_woning_applies_fks_by_product | split: '|'
  assign woning_applies_list = zv_woning_applies_handles | split: '|'
  assign woning_applies_fk_list = zv_woning_applies_fks | split: '|'
  assign woning_line_log = ''
  assign woning_floor_log = ''
  assign woning_line_undiscounted = false
  assign woning_line_price_off = false
  assign cart_woning_bad = false

  comment
    Riders (2026-10-27): the camera subscription rides with ADC-750, the bought
    Videodeurbel ('leadVariant:riderVariant:cents|…', zv-addon-riders). zv-cart-guard keeps one
    rider line at quantity zv_promo_package_qty while a lead line is in the cart and none
    otherwise; until it has, checkout waits (cart_needs_fix, below the loop). Since 2026-10-28
    it prepays the months like Ontzorgpakket, in the "Eerste 3 maanden" discount (50% off); not in
    "Daarna" (open, like the Huren rentals: unresolved.ODOO_ADDON_BILLING).
  endcomment
  capture zv_rider_pairs
    render 'zv-addon-riders', map: zv_addon_rider_by_lead
  endcapture
  assign zv_rider_pairs = zv_rider_pairs | strip
  assign zv_rider_pair_list = zv_rider_pairs | split: '|'
  assign zv_rider_variant_ids = ''
  for rp in zv_rider_pair_list
    assign rpp = rp | split: ':'
    assign zv_rider_variant_ids = zv_rider_variant_ids | append: '|' | append: rpp[1]
  endfor
  assign zv_rider_variant_id_list = zv_rider_variant_ids | remove_first: '|' | split: '|'
  assign today_cents = 0
  assign true_month_cents = 0
  assign install_line_item = nil
  assign pkg_line_item = nil
  assign pkg_item_fk = blank
  assign distinct_pkg_fks = ''
  assign has_climax_pkg = false
  assign has_nami_pkg = false
  assign has_activation_line = false
  assign has_nami_install_line = false
  assign selected_nami_install_id = nil
  assign selected_nami_install_cents = 0
  assign pkg_woning_floors = 0
  assign cart_needs_fix = false
  assign cart_pkg_undiscounted = false
  assign cart_koop_bad = false
  assign distinct_koop_fks = ''
  for item in cart.items
    if activation_variant_id != blank and item.variant_id == activation_variant_id
      assign has_activation_line = true
      assign install_line_item = item
    endif
    if nami_install_geen_variant_id != blank and item.variant_id == nami_install_geen_variant_id
      assign has_nami_install_line = true
      assign selected_nami_install_id = 'geen'
      assign selected_nami_install_cents = zv_nami_install_geen_cents
      assign install_line_item = item
    endif
    if nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id != blank and item.variant_id == nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id
      assign has_nami_install_line = true
      assign selected_nami_install_id = 'telefonisch'
      assign selected_nami_install_cents = zv_nami_install_telefonisch_cents
      assign install_line_item = item
    endif
    if nami_install_huis_variant_id != blank and item.variant_id == nami_install_huis_variant_id
      assign has_nami_install_line = true
      assign selected_nami_install_id = 'huis'
      assign selected_nami_install_cents = zv_nami_install_huis_cents
      assign install_line_item = item
    endif

    comment
      An installation line (CL003 or one of the 3 NAMI variants) at any quantity other
      than 1 blocks checkout the same way as a wrong package quantity; zv-cart-guard
      resets it to 1 and reloads.
    endcomment
    if item.variant_id == activation_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_geen_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_huis_variant_id
      if item.quantity != 1
        assign cart_needs_fix = true
      endif
    endif

    assign today_cents = today_cents | plus: item.final_line_price

    comment
      A Woning line: counted in today_cents above like every line, never in "Daarna" (the
      package lines' Woning property carries the surcharge there). Collected for the gate: which
      Woning product and its quantity (woning_line_log), whether the promo discount reached it,
      and whether its unit price is the config's unit (never charge more than
      zv_woning_unit_cents per floor). The last two hold for every Woning product alike.
    endcomment
    assign item_vid = item.variant_id | append: ''
    if woning_variant_id_list contains item_vid
      for wid in woning_variant_id_list
        if wid == item_vid
          assign woning_line_log = woning_line_log | append: forloop.index0 | append: ':' | append: item.quantity | append: '|'
        endif
      endfor
      if item.final_line_price >= item.original_line_price
        assign woning_line_undiscounted = true
      endif
      if item.original_price != zv_woning_unit_cents
        assign woning_line_price_off = true
      endif
    endif

    comment
      Ontzorgpakket (per package since 2026-10-27): a confirmed recurring monthly service, so
      its unit price counts toward "Daarna" too. Counted independently of the package-line
      block below. NOTE: the Huren hardware add-ons (huur-afstandsbediening H0010,
      huur-video-deurbel-750 H750, productType "Huur Componenten", EUR/mnd) are monthly rentals
      too but sync at quantity 1 and are not in "Daarna" — an open question (how Odoo bills
      them), not decided here.
    endcomment
    if zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list contains item_vid
      assign true_month_cents = true_month_cents | plus: item.original_price
    endif

    comment
      A Koop package line (Huren/Kopen): quantity 1, no discount, one line per package. It needs
      its installGroup's installation like a rented package. Its Woning choice counts towards its
      platform's Woning line the same as a rented package's (2026-10-28, see below); Woning on a
      Koop line whose package doesn't offer it is something zv-cart-guard deletes, so checkout
      waits.
    endcomment
    capture item_koop_fk
      render 'zv-koop-fk', handle: item.product.handle, afname: item.properties['Afname'], map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle
    endcapture
    assign item_koop_fk = item_koop_fk | strip
    if item_koop_fk == 'invalid'
      assign cart_koop_bad = true
    elsif item_koop_fk != blank
      if item_koop_fk == 'aware' or item_koop_fk == 'aware_plus' or item_koop_fk == 'secure'
        assign has_nami_pkg = true
      else
        assign has_climax_pkg = true
      endif
      if item.properties['Woning'] != blank
        unless woning_applies_fk_list contains item_koop_fk
          assign cart_needs_fix = true
        endunless
      endif
      comment
        Woning on a bought package (2026-10-28): follows the same path as Ontzorgpakket now —
        its floors feed woning_floor_log exactly like a rented package's, just matched by
        finder_key (woning_applies_fks_by_product) since a Koop line's handle isn't in
        woning_applies_by_product. Was property-only (Thijs, 2026-10-24 NAMI / 2026-10-27
        Climax); nothing ever billed it because neither Shopify nor Odoo had a line to key off.
      endcomment
      if item.properties['Woning'] != blank and woning_applies_fk_list contains item_koop_fk
        capture item_koop_woning_floors
          render 'zv-woning-floors', value: item.properties['Woning'], v1: zv_woning_1_value, v2: zv_woning_2_value, legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix
        endcapture
        assign item_koop_woning_floors = item_koop_woning_floors | strip | plus: 0
        if item_koop_woning_floors > 0
          for wa_fk in woning_applies_fks_by_product_list
            assign wa_fk_list = wa_fk | split: ','
            if wa_fk_list contains item_koop_fk
              assign woning_floor_log = woning_floor_log | append: forloop.index0 | append: ':' | append: item_koop_woning_floors | append: '|'
            endif
          endfor
        endif
      endif
      if item.quantity != 1
        assign cart_needs_fix = true
      endif
      if item.final_line_price < item.original_line_price
        assign cart_koop_bad = true
      endif
      assign koop_fk_token = item_koop_fk | append: '|'
      if distinct_koop_fks contains koop_fk_token
        assign cart_needs_fix = true
      else
        assign distinct_koop_fks = distinct_koop_fks | append: koop_fk_token
      endif
    endif

    comment
      A package line: product type sub_type plus one of the 5 purchasable finder_keys. Never a
      Koop line, whatever its product type.
    endcomment
    assign item_pkg_fk = blank
    if item.product.type == sub_type or item.product.tags contains sub_tag
      assign item_fk = item.product.metafields.custom.finder_key.value
      if item_fk == 'aware' or item_fk == 'aware_plus' or item_fk == 'secure' or item_fk == 'care' or item_fk == 'guard'
        assign item_pkg_fk = item_fk
      endif
    endif
    if item_koop_fk != blank
      assign item_pkg_fk = blank
    endif

    if item_pkg_fk != blank
      comment
        Woning surcharge (spec §7; NAMI since 2026-09-25, Climax since 2026-10-27): the Woning
        property on a package line whose package offers it (zv_woning_applies_handles). Its first
        3 months are its platform's Woning line (woning_floor_log: the product whose packages
        include this handle), charged today; Odoo bills it from month 4 with the package, so it
        counts in "Daarna" (+zv_woning_unit_cents per floor) and in the ICV below.
        zv-woning-floors reads the legacy "Groter dan 100 m²…" value as 1 floor. Woning on a
        package that doesn't offer it is something zv-cart-guard deletes, so checkout waits.
      endcomment
      assign item_woning_floors = 0
      if woning_applies_list contains item.product.handle
        capture item_woning_floors
          render 'zv-woning-floors', value: item.properties['Woning'], v1: zv_woning_1_value, v2: zv_woning_2_value, legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix
        endcapture
        assign item_woning_floors = item_woning_floors | strip | plus: 0
        if item_woning_floors > 0
          for wa in woning_applies_by_product_list
            assign wa_list = wa | split: ','
            if wa_list contains item.product.handle
              assign woning_floor_log = woning_floor_log | append: forloop.index0 | append: ':' | append: item_woning_floors | append: '|'
            endif
          endfor
        endif
      elsif item.properties['Woning'] != blank
        assign cart_needs_fix = true
      endif
      assign item_woning_cents = zv_woning_unit_cents | times: item_woning_floors
      if item_pkg_fk == 'aware' or item_pkg_fk == 'aware_plus' or item_pkg_fk == 'secure'
        assign has_nami_pkg = true
      else
        assign has_climax_pkg = true
      endif
      if pkg_line_item == nil
        assign pkg_line_item = item
        assign pkg_item_fk = item_pkg_fk
        assign pkg_woning_floors = item_woning_floors
      endif
      if item.quantity != zv_promo_package_qty
        assign cart_needs_fix = true
      endif
      if item.final_line_price >= item.original_line_price
        assign cart_pkg_undiscounted = true
      endif
      assign true_month_cents = true_month_cents | plus: item.original_price | plus: item_woning_cents
      assign fk_token = item_pkg_fk | append: '|'
      if distinct_pkg_fks contains fk_token
        assign cart_needs_fix = true
      else
        assign distinct_pkg_fks = distinct_pkg_fks | append: fk_token
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  for d in cart.cart_level_discount_applications
    assign today_cents = today_cents | minus: d.total_allocated_amount
  endfor

  comment
    A climax package needs the single Climax installation line (activation_variant_id /
    climax-instalatie, CL003, no ambiguity). A nami package needs one of the 3
    installationOptions.nami variants instead - never the Climax line, and never
    auto-picked on the customer's behalf (see zv-cart-guard.liquid). A cart can need
    either or both independently if it somehow holds both platforms at once - this check
    is intentionally independent of the "exactly one recognized package" gate below,
    which only controls the commercial-terms display, not this safety gate.
  endcomment
  assign cart_needs_activation = false
  if has_climax_pkg and has_activation_line == false
    assign cart_needs_activation = true
  endif
  if has_nami_pkg and has_nami_install_line == false
    assign cart_needs_activation = true
  endif
  if has_activation_line and has_climax_pkg == false
    assign cart_needs_fix = true
  endif

  comment
    cart_woning_bad (next to cart_pkg_undiscounted, same contact message), per Woning product
    that resolves (one for the NAMI packages, one for the Climax packages): its quantity isn't
    pkg_qty x the floors of ITS OWN package lines (or it's split over several lines), or any
    Woning line carries no discount, or its unit price isn't zv_woning_unit_cents. The last one
    means the Shopify product's price differs from the config; never overcharge for it.
  endcomment
  assign woning_line_log_list = woning_line_log | split: '|'
  assign woning_floor_log_list = woning_floor_log | split: '|'
  for wid in woning_variant_id_list
    if wid == '0'
      continue
    endif
    assign w_idx = forloop.index0 | append: ''
    assign w_count = 0
    assign w_qty = 0
    for e in woning_line_log_list
      assign ep = e | split: ':'
      if ep[0] == w_idx
        assign w_count = w_count | plus: 1
        assign w_qty = w_qty | plus: ep[1]
      endif
    endfor
    assign w_floors = 0
    for e in woning_floor_log_list
      assign ep = e | split: ':'
      if ep[0] == w_idx
        assign w_floors = w_floors | plus: ep[1]
      endif
    endfor
    assign w_target = w_floors | times: zv_promo_package_qty
    if w_qty != w_target or w_count > 1
      assign cart_woning_bad = true
    endif
  endfor
  if woning_line_log != '' and woning_line_undiscounted
    assign cart_woning_bad = true
  endif
  if woning_line_log != '' and woning_line_price_off
    assign cart_woning_bad = true
  endif

  comment
    Riders: a lead line needs exactly one rider line at quantity zv_promo_package_qty (2026-10-28:
    the camera subscription prepays the months like Ontzorgpakket, was flat 1), and a rider line needs a lead
    line. zv-cart-guard fixes either (rule 7); until then checkout waits.
  endcomment
  assign r_rider_target = zv_promo_package_qty
  if r_rider_target < 1
    assign r_rider_target = 1
  endif
  for rp in zv_rider_pair_list
    assign rpp = rp | split: ':'
    assign r_lead_lines = 0
    assign r_rider_lines = 0
    assign r_rider_qty = 0
    for item in cart.items
      assign r_vid = item.variant_id | append: ''
      if r_vid == rpp[0]
        assign r_lead_lines = r_lead_lines | plus: 1
      elsif r_vid == rpp[1]
        assign r_rider_lines = r_rider_lines | plus: 1
        assign r_rider_qty = r_rider_qty | plus: item.quantity
      endif
    endfor
    if r_lead_lines > 0
      if r_rider_lines != 1 or r_rider_qty != r_rider_target
        assign cart_needs_fix = true
      endif
    elsif r_rider_lines > 0
      assign cart_needs_fix = true
    endif
  endfor
  assign cart_checkout_blocked = false
  if cart_needs_activation or cart_needs_fix or cart_pkg_undiscounted or cart_woning_bad or cart_koop_bad
    assign cart_checkout_blocked = true
  endif
-%}
{%- render 'zv-cart-guard', activation_variant_id: activation_variant_id, sub_type: sub_type, nami_geen_variant_id: nami_install_geen_variant_id, nami_telefonisch_variant_id: nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id, nami_huis_variant_id: nami_install_huis_variant_id, pkg_qty: zv_promo_package_qty, inzicht_handle: zv_inzicht_handle, zeker_handle: zv_zeker_handle, beschermd_handle: zv_beschermd_handle, alert_handle: zv_alert_handle, protect_handle: zv_protect_handle, woning_variant_ids: woning_variant_ids, woning_applies_by_product: zv_woning_applies_by_product, woning_applies_fks_by_product: zv_woning_applies_fks_by_product, woning_v1: zv_woning_1_value, woning_v2: zv_woning_2_value, woning_legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix, woning_applies: zv_woning_applies_handles, woning_applies_fks: zv_woning_applies_fks, rider_pairs: zv_rider_pairs, koop_map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle -%}
{%- liquid

  comment
    Commercial-terms rows (installation, contract duration, ICV) only apply when the
    cart holds exactly one recognized package. A cart holding two different packages
    (e.g. Langer Thuis Inzicht + Mijn Thuis Alert) has two different contract terms and
    ICVs at once; showing either one alone would be confidently wrong, not just
    incomplete, so both fall back to the live-totals-only view instead. The "Daarna"
    sum above is unaffected by this - it stays correct across multiple packages, being
    just a sum of each package line's own unit price.
  endcomment
  assign distinct_pkg_fk_count = distinct_pkg_fks | split: '|' | size
  assign pkg_available = false
  assign pkg_install_group = 'climax'
  assign pkg_woning_icv_1 = 0
  assign pkg_woning_icv_2 = 0
  if pkg_line_item != nil and distinct_pkg_fk_count == 1
    case pkg_item_fk
      when 'aware'
        assign pkg_available = true
        assign pkg_install_group = 'nami'
        assign pkg_term = zv_inzicht_term
        assign pkg_icv = zv_inzicht_icv
        assign pkg_icv_cents_base = zv_inzicht_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_1 = zv_inzicht_woning_1_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_2 = zv_inzicht_woning_2_icv_cents
        assign pkg_meldkamer = false
      when 'aware_plus'
        assign pkg_available = true
        assign pkg_install_group = 'nami'
        assign pkg_term = zv_zeker_term
        assign pkg_icv = zv_zeker_icv
        assign pkg_icv_cents_base = zv_zeker_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_1 = zv_zeker_woning_1_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_2 = zv_zeker_woning_2_icv_cents
        assign pkg_meldkamer = false
      when 'care'
        assign pkg_available = true
        assign pkg_install_group = 'climax'
        assign pkg_term = zv_beschermd_term
        assign pkg_icv = zv_beschermd_icv
        assign pkg_icv_cents_base = zv_beschermd_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_1 = zv_beschermd_woning_1_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_2 = zv_beschermd_woning_2_icv_cents
        assign pkg_meldkamer = true
      when 'secure'
        assign pkg_available = true
        assign pkg_install_group = 'nami'
        assign pkg_term = zv_alert_term
        assign pkg_icv = zv_alert_icv
        assign pkg_icv_cents_base = zv_alert_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_1 = zv_alert_woning_1_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_2 = zv_alert_woning_2_icv_cents
        assign pkg_meldkamer = false
      when 'guard'
        assign pkg_available = true
        assign pkg_install_group = 'climax'
        assign pkg_term = zv_protect_term
        assign pkg_icv = zv_protect_icv
        assign pkg_icv_cents_base = zv_protect_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_1 = zv_protect_woning_1_icv_cents
        assign pkg_woning_icv_2 = zv_protect_woning_2_icv_cents
        assign pkg_meldkamer = true
    endcase
  endif

  comment
    Nami ICV swaps the flat activation fee baked into pkg_icv_cents_base for whichever
    installationOptions.nami variant is actually in the live cart. Only overrides the
    pre-formatted pkg_icv string when the amount actually differs from the build-time
    default (true for every climax cart, always, and for nami carts where nothing is
    chosen yet or "huis" - same 4900 cents as activation - is chosen), so the existing
    eur()-formatted string (with its thousands separator) survives untouched in the
    common case and Climax never changes. Only the 2 differently-priced nami options
    (geen/telefonisch) render via the `money` filter instead - correct amount, Shopify's
    native formatting, at the cost of a barely-visible space-after-symbol difference vs the
    rest of the page (eur()-formatted strings include it, the shop's money_format does not)
    in that narrow case.
  endcomment
  assign pkg_icv_cents_final = pkg_icv_cents_base
  if pkg_install_group == 'nami' and selected_nami_install_id != nil
    assign pkg_icv_cents_adjusted = pkg_icv_cents_base | minus: zv_activation_cents | plus: selected_nami_install_cents
    if pkg_icv_cents_adjusted != pkg_icv_cents_base
      assign pkg_icv = pkg_icv_cents_adjusted | money
    endif
    assign pkg_icv_cents_final = pkg_icv_cents_adjusted
  endif

  comment
    Woning surcharge in the ICV (every package that offers Woning; Climax since 2026-10-27):
    the build's per-package value for 1 or 2 floors, floors x (3 x half_up(zv_woning_unit_cents
    x 50%) + zv_woning_unit_cents x (termMonths - 3)): the Woning line's 3 prepaid months at what
    they cost today plus the months Odoo bills (Thijs 2026-09-25): +€42/+€84 at 12 months,
    +€138/+€276 at 36. Only when the package line carries a Woning choice, so a cart without one
    keeps the pre-formatted pkg_icv string untouched.
  endcomment
  assign pkg_woning_icv_cents = 0
  if pkg_available and pkg_woning_floors == 1
    assign pkg_woning_icv_cents = pkg_woning_icv_1
  elsif pkg_available and pkg_woning_floors == 2
    assign pkg_woning_icv_cents = pkg_woning_icv_2
  endif
  if pkg_woning_icv_cents > 0
    assign pkg_icv_cents_final = pkg_icv_cents_final | plus: pkg_woning_icv_cents
    assign pkg_icv = pkg_icv_cents_final | money
  endif

  comment
    The NAMI installation choice (radio group, "Installatie" row, delivery text) shows whenever
    the cart holds a NAMI package, rented or bought (has_nami_pkg, the same flag the
    cart_needs_activation gate uses), not only when exactly one rented package is recognized:
    a cart with only a Koop NAMI line must be able to choose, or the gate would block it for
    good (Huren/Kopen, 2026-10-24).
  endcomment
  assign show_nami_install = has_nami_pkg

  comment
    A cart that buys a package and rents none has no contract term: no "Opzeggen ... na afloop
    van de contractduur" row (the Koop service fee's own terms are Odoo's, not shown here).
  endcomment
  assign koop_only = false
  if distinct_koop_fks != '' and pkg_line_item == nil
    assign koop_only = true
  endif
-%}
{%- capture av_url -%}{% render 'zv-route', key: 'algemene-voorwaarden' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture privacy_url -%}{% render 'zv-route', key: 'privacyverklaring' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture herroeping_url -%}{% render 'zv-route', key: 'herroepingsrecht' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign consent_prefix = section.settings.consent_prefix | default: 'Ik ga akkoord met de' -%}
{%- assign consent_suffix = section.settings.consent_suffix | default: 'en de betaalplicht.' -%}
{%- capture privacy_html -%}ons privacybeleid (<a href="{{ privacy_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy</a>){%- endcapture -%}
{%- if pkg_available -%}
  {%- assign consent_middle = section.settings.consent_middle | default: ', de contractduur van' -%}
  {%- capture consent_html -%}{{ consent_prefix }} <a href="{{ av_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Algemene Voorwaarden</a>{{ consent_middle }} {{ pkg_term }} maanden, {{ privacy_html }} {{ consent_suffix }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- capture consent_html -%}{{ consent_prefix }} <a href="{{ av_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Algemene Voorwaarden</a>, {{ privacy_html }} {{ consent_suffix }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}

<div class="zv-overzicht" data-zv-overzicht{% if cart.item_count == 0 %} data-cart-empty{% endif %}{% if cart_checkout_blocked %} data-needs-activation{% endif %} data-cart-sig="{% for item in cart.items %}{{ item.key | escape }}:{{ item.quantity }},{% endfor %}">
  <section class="ovbar">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="ovbar-top">
        <h1>{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Overzicht' | escape }}</h1>
        <a class="ovback" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5M11 6l-6 6 6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Terug naar winkelwagen</a>
      </div>
      {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}<p class="ovsub">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <ol class="ovsteps" aria-label="Bestelstappen">
        <li class="done"><span class="n"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Winkelwagen</li>
        <li class="active" aria-current="step"><span class="n">2</span>Overzicht</li>
        <li><span class="n">3</span>Afrekenen</li>
        <li><span class="n">4</span>Bevestiging</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <noscript><div class="wrap"><p class="ovnoscript">Deze pagina werkt het beste met JavaScript ingeschakeld. <a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Ga terug naar de winkelwagen</a>.</p></div></noscript>

  {%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
    <section class="ovwrap">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="olayout">
          <div class="ov-left">
            <div class="ovcard">
              <div class="ovcard-head">
                <h2>{{ section.settings.pkg_card_heading | default: 'Uw pakket en configuratie' | escape }}</h2>
                <a class="ovedit" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">{{ section.settings.pkg_card_link_label | default: 'Wijzig in winkelwagen' | escape }}</a>
              </div>
              {%- comment -%}
                Huren/Kopen groups (2026-10-28, docs/cart-huur-koop-split-2026-10-28.md), the same as /cart:
                snippets/zv-cart-line-group.liquid decides each line's group (its own billing cadence, never
                the flow that added it), snippets/zv-cart-group-label.liquid has the copy. A group's
                subtotal is its lines' final_line_price. The cost card on the right reuses these keys,
                subtotals and sorted_items for its own breakdown (2026-10-29); its "Vandaag te betalen" and
                "Daarna" still come from today_cents / true_month_cents above.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign sorted_items = cart.items | sort: 'final_line_price' | reverse
                assign cg_huren_keys = '|'
                assign cg_kopen_keys = '|'
                assign cg_huren_cents = 0
                assign cg_kopen_cents = 0
                for item in sorted_items
                  capture cg_group
                    render 'zv-cart-line-group', item: item, sub_type: sub_type, sub_tag: sub_tag, woning_ids: woning_variant_id_list, ontzorg_ids: zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list, rider_ids: zv_rider_variant_id_list, addon_videodeurbel_id: zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id, addon_afstandsbediening_id: zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id
                  endcapture
                  assign cg_group = cg_group | strip
                  if cg_group == 'huren'
                    assign cg_huren_keys = cg_huren_keys | append: item.key | append: '|'
                    assign cg_huren_cents = cg_huren_cents | plus: item.final_line_price
                  else
                    assign cg_kopen_keys = cg_kopen_keys | append: item.key | append: '|'
                    assign cg_kopen_cents = cg_kopen_cents | plus: item.final_line_price
                  endif
                endfor
                assign cg_groups = 'huren,kopen' | split: ','
              -%}
              <div class="ovitems">
                {%- for cg in cg_groups -%}
                  {%- if cg == 'huren' -%}
                    {%- assign cg_keys = cg_huren_keys -%}{%- assign cg_cents = cg_huren_cents -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- assign cg_keys = cg_kopen_keys -%}{%- assign cg_cents = cg_kopen_cents -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if cg_keys == '|' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  <div class="ovgroup ovgroup--{{ cg }}">
                    <h3 class="ovg-head">{% render 'zv-cart-group-label', group: cg %}</h3>
                    {%- for item in sorted_items -%}
                      {%- assign cg_key = '|' | append: item.key | append: '|' -%}
                      {%- unless cg_keys contains cg_key -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
                      {%- assign item_vid = item.variant_id | append: '' -%}
                      {%- if woning_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}
                        {%- comment -%} A Woning line: one non-editable row, "Woning: <option value>" from its own package lines' Woning values (zv-woning-label, never the product title), at its real final_line_price. {%- endcomment -%}
                        {%- capture woning_label -%}{%- render 'zv-woning-label', variant_id: item_vid, variant_ids: woning_variant_ids, applies_by_product: zv_woning_applies_by_product, v1: zv_woning_1_value, v2: zv_woning_2_value, legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                        {%- assign woning_label = woning_label | strip -%}
                        <div class="ovitem ovitem--woning">
                          <div class="ovi-thumb">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                          </div>
                          <div>
                            <div class="ovi-name">Woning{% if woning_label != '' %}: {{ woning_label | escape }}{% endif %}</div>
                            <div class="ovi-meta">Eerste {{ zv_promo_months }} maanden vooruit, daarna in het maandbedrag van uw pakket</div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="ovi-right">
                            {%- render 'zv-cart-line-price', item: item, woning: true, pkg_qty: zv_promo_package_qty, price_class: 'ovi-price', note_class: 'ovi-meta' -%}
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        {%- continue -%}
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- capture ovi_koop_fk -%}{%- render 'zv-koop-fk', handle: item.product.handle, afname: item.properties['Afname'], map: zv_koop_fk_by_handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                      {%- assign ovi_koop_fk = ovi_koop_fk | strip -%}
                      {%- assign ovi_is_koop = false -%}
                      {%- if ovi_koop_fk != blank and ovi_koop_fk != 'invalid' -%}{%- assign ovi_is_koop = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                      {%- assign is_sub = false -%}
                      {%- if item.product.type == sub_type or item.product.tags contains sub_tag -%}{%- assign is_sub = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                      {%- if ovi_is_koop -%}{%- assign is_sub = false -%}{%- endif -%}
                      {%- comment -%} Package and installation lines show their pricing.config.json name (package via finder_key, installation via handle), never the Shopify product title. A Koop line shows its package's name. {%- endcomment -%}
                      {%- assign item_name = item.product.title -%}
                      {%- if is_sub -%}
                        {%- capture cfg_name -%}{%- render 'zv-package-name', finder_key: item.product.metafields.custom.finder_key.value, names: zv_package_names_by_fk -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                      {%- elsif ovi_is_koop -%}
                        {%- capture cfg_name -%}{%- render 'zv-package-name', finder_key: ovi_koop_fk, names: zv_package_names_by_fk -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                      {%- elsif item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id -%}
                        {%- assign cfg_name = 'Videodeurbel (kopen)' -%}
                      {%- elsif item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id -%}
                        {%- assign cfg_name = 'Afstandsbediening (kopen)' -%}
                      {%- else -%}
                        {%- capture cfg_name -%}{%- render 'zv-install-name', handle: item.product.handle, names: zv_install_names_by_handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- assign cfg_name = cfg_name | strip -%}
                      {%- if cfg_name != blank -%}{%- assign item_name = cfg_name -%}{%- endif -%}
                      <div class="ovitem">
                        <div class="ovi-thumb">
                          {%- if item.image -%}
                            <img src="{{ item.image | image_url: width: 176 }}" alt="{{ item_name | escape }}" width="88" height="88" loading="lazy">
                          {%- else -%}
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8l9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M3 8v8l9 4 9-4V8M12 12v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                        <div>
                          {%- comment -%} Installation lines (CL003 and the 3 NAMI options) always read "Installatie": Odoo sets their product type (e.g. "All"), which isn't customer copy. {%- endcomment -%}
                          {%- assign ovi_is_install = false -%}
                          {%- if item.variant_id == activation_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_geen_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id or item.variant_id == nami_install_huis_variant_id -%}{%- assign ovi_is_install = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                          {%- assign ovi_is_addon = false -%}{%- if zv_rider_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}{%- assign ovi_is_addon = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                          {%- if item.variant_id == zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id or zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list contains item_vid or item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id or item.variant_id == zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id -%}{%- assign ovi_is_addon = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                          {%- if ovi_is_install -%}<span class="ovi-line">Installatie</span>{%- elsif ovi_is_koop -%}<span class="ovi-line">Kopen</span>{%- elsif ovi_is_addon -%}<span class="ovi-line">Uitbreiding</span>{%- elsif item.product.type != blank -%}<span class="ovi-line">{{ item.product.type | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                          <div class="ovi-name">{{ item_name | escape }}</div>
                          {%- unless item.variant.title contains 'Default' -%}<div class="ovi-meta">{{ item.variant.title | escape }}</div>{%- endunless -%}
                          {%- if is_sub -%}
                              {%- comment -%} Woning meta on package lines whose package offers Woning (zv_woning_applies_handles). {%- endcomment -%}
                            {%- assign ovi_wf = 0 -%}
                            {%- if woning_applies_list contains item.product.handle -%}
                              {%- capture ovi_wf -%}{%- render 'zv-woning-floors', value: item.properties['Woning'], v1: zv_woning_1_value, v2: zv_woning_2_value, legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                            {%- endif -%}
                            {%- assign ovi_wf = ovi_wf | strip | plus: 0 -%}
                            {%- if ovi_wf > 0 -%}
                              {%- if ovi_wf == 2 -%}{%- assign ovi_wl = zv_woning_2_value -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign ovi_wl = zv_woning_1_value -%}{%- endif -%}
                              {%- assign ovi_wc = zv_woning_unit_cents | times: ovi_wf -%}
                              <div class="ovi-meta">Woning: {{ ovi_wl | escape }} (+{{ ovi_wc | money_without_trailing_zeros }}/mnd)</div>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          {%- elsif ovi_is_koop -%}
                            {%- comment -%} A bought package: the apparatuur once, no looptijd. Woning on a bought package is its property only, billed by Odoo with the service fee, never a line here. {%- endcomment -%}
                            <div class="ovi-meta">Apparatuur, eenmalig</div>
                            {%- assign ovi_wf = 0 -%}
                            {%- if woning_applies_fk_list contains ovi_koop_fk -%}
                              {%- capture ovi_wf -%}{%- render 'zv-woning-floors', value: item.properties['Woning'], v1: zv_woning_1_value, v2: zv_woning_2_value, legacy: zv_woning_legacy_prefix -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                            {%- endif -%}
                            {%- assign ovi_wf = ovi_wf | strip | plus: 0 -%}
                            {%- if ovi_wf > 0 -%}
                              {%- if ovi_wf == 2 -%}{%- assign ovi_wl = zv_woning_2_value -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign ovi_wl = zv_woning_1_value -%}{%- endif -%}
                              {%- assign ovi_wc = zv_woning_unit_cents | times: ovi_wf -%}
                              <div class="ovi-meta">Woning: {{ ovi_wl | escape }} (+{{ ovi_wc | money_without_trailing_zeros }}/mnd)</div>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          {%- elsif zv_rider_variant_id_list contains item_vid -%}
                            <div class="ovi-meta">Hoort bij uw gekochte videodeurbel</div>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <div class="ovi-meta">Aantal: {{ item.quantity }}</div>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                        <div class="ovi-right">
                          {%- comment -%} A package line's monthly figure is its UNIT price before the discount, never unit x quantity. {%- endcomment -%}
                          {%- if is_sub -%}
                            <div class="ovi-price">{{ item.original_price | money }} <span>p/m</span></div>
                            <div class="ovi-meta">Vandaag, {{ item.quantity }} maanden vooruit:</div>
                            {%- render 'zv-cart-line-price', item: item, price_class: 'ovi-price', note_class: 'ovi-meta' -%}
                            {%- if item.line_level_discount_allocations.size == 0 -%}<div class="ovi-meta">Loopt daarna door via SEPA-incasso.</div>{%- endif -%}
                          {%- else -%}
                            {%- render 'zv-cart-line-price', item: item, price_class: 'ovi-price', note_class: 'ovi-meta' -%}
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                    <div class="ovg-sub"><span>{% render 'zv-cart-group-label', group: cg, part: 'subtotal' %}</span><b>{{ cg_cents | money }}</b></div>
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
              {%- if show_nami_install -%}
                <div class="ovinstall-section">
                  <span class="ovi-line">Installatie</span>
                  <div class="ovinstall-options" data-ov-install-options role="radiogroup" aria-label="Installatie">
                    <label class="ovinstall-opt">
                      <input type="radio" name="ov_install_option" required
                        data-install-variant-id="{{ nami_install_geen_variant_id }}"
                        data-install-cents="{{ zv_nami_install_geen_cents }}"
                        {%- if selected_nami_install_id == 'geen' %} checked{% endif %}>
                      <span class="ovinstall-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M5.5 5.5l13 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                      </span>
                      <span class="ovinstall-title">{{ zv_nami_install_geen_label }}</span>
                      <span class="ovinstall-price">{{ zv_nami_install_geen_display }}</span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="ovinstall-opt">
                      <input type="radio" name="ov_install_option" required
                        data-install-variant-id="{{ nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id }}"
                        data-install-cents="{{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_cents }}"
                        {%- if selected_nami_install_id == 'telefonisch' %} checked{% endif %}>
                      <span class="ovinstall-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                      </span>
                      <span class="ovinstall-title">{{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_label }}</span>
                      <span class="ovinstall-price">{{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_display }}</span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="ovinstall-opt">
                      <input type="radio" name="ov_install_option" required
                        data-install-variant-id="{{ nami_install_huis_variant_id }}"
                        data-install-cents="{{ zv_nami_install_huis_cents }}"
                        {%- if selected_nami_install_id == 'huis' %} checked{% endif %}>
                      <span class="ovinstall-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                      </span>
                      <span class="ovinstall-title">{{ zv_nami_install_huis_label }}</span>
                      <span class="ovinstall-price">{{ zv_nami_install_huis_display }}</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ovinstall-err" data-ov-install-err hidden>Er ging iets mis bij het opslaan van uw keuze. Probeer het opnieuw.</div>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ov-right">
            <div class="ovcard ovcost">
              <h2>{{ section.settings.cost_card_heading | default: 'Uw kosten in het kort' | escape }}</h2>
              {%- if section.settings.cost_card_sub != blank -%}<p class="ovcost-sub">{{ section.settings.cost_card_sub | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}

              {%- comment -%}
                Itemized, never a single collapsed number: every row is read straight off
                the live cart line it describes (item.final_line_price, after Shopify's own
                discount allocation), so the breakdown always equals what Shopify charges -
                nothing is recomputed here. The installation row is whichever install option
                is really in the cart (the Climax line for climax, one of the 3 nami options
                for nami) at its full price - installation is never discounted. The package
                row is the package line itself: quantity 3, with Shopify's automatic 50%
                "Eerste 3 maanden" discount already taken off. Their sum is today_cents.
                "Daarna" is each package line's unit price before the discount.
                Huren/Kopen (2026-10-29, docs/overzicht-cost-card-timeline-2026-10-29.md): the rows come in
                the same two groups and the same order as the item list on the left (its cg_* keys and
                subtotals and sorted_items, not recomputed), each group closed by its "Subtotaal vandaag".
                "Vandaag te betalen" and "Daarna" follow both groups, unchanged. Each row is labelled with
                the line's bare name from snippets/zv-cart-row-name.liquid (shared with /cart's summary):
                no "× 3 — eerste 3 maanden (…)" or "— kopen, eenmalig" suffix, the group heading says it.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="ovblock">
                <span class="ovblock-eb">{{ zv_label_breakdown_intro }}</span>
                {%- if section.settings.due_today_text != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.due_today_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
                {%- comment -%}
                  One row per live cart line, so the rows always add up to the total below
                  - including the rare cart holding two packages at once. An unrecognized
                  line falls back to its own product title, same degraded-but-honest
                  convention used elsewhere.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- for cg in cg_groups -%}
                  {%- if cg == 'huren' -%}
                    {%- assign cg_keys = cg_huren_keys -%}{%- assign cg_cents = cg_huren_cents -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- assign cg_keys = cg_kopen_keys -%}{%- assign cg_cents = cg_kopen_cents -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if cg_keys == '|' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  <div class="ovbreakdown-group">
                    <h3 class="ovg-head">{% render 'zv-cart-group-label', group: cg %}</h3>
                    <dl class="ovdl ovbreakdown">
                      {%- for item in sorted_items -%}
                        {%- assign cg_key = '|' | append: item.key | append: '|' -%}
                        {%- unless cg_keys contains cg_key -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
                        {%- capture row_label -%}{%- render 'zv-cart-row-name', item: item, sub_type: sub_type, sub_tag: sub_tag, zv_package_names_by_fk: zv_package_names_by_fk, zv_install_names_by_handle: zv_install_names_by_handle, zv_koop_fk_by_handle: zv_koop_fk_by_handle, zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id: zv_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id, zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id: zv_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id, zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id: zv_koop_addon_videodeurbel_variant_id, zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id: zv_koop_addon_afstandsbediening_variant_id, zv_rider_variant_id_list: zv_rider_variant_id_list, zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list: zv_ontzorg_variant_id_list, woning_variant_id_list: woning_variant_id_list, woning_variant_ids: woning_variant_ids, zv_woning_applies_by_product: zv_woning_applies_by_product, zv_woning_1_value: zv_woning_1_value, zv_woning_2_value: zv_woning_2_value, zv_woning_legacy_prefix: zv_woning_legacy_prefix, activation_variant_id: activation_variant_id, nami_install_geen_variant_id: nami_install_geen_variant_id, nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id: nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id, nami_install_huis_variant_id: nami_install_huis_variant_id -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                        <div><dt>{{ row_label | strip | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ item.final_line_price | money }}</dd></div>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                      <div class="ovbreakdown-sub"><dt>{% render 'zv-cart-group-label', group: cg, part: 'subtotal' %}</dt><dd>{{ cg_cents | money }}</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
                <dl class="ovdl ovbreakdown">
                  <div class="ovbreakdown-total"><dt>{{ zv_label_due_today }}</dt><dd class="strong">{{ today_cents | money }}</dd></div>
                  {%- if true_month_cents > 0 -%}
                    <div><dt>Daarna</dt><dd>{{ true_month_cents | money }}/mnd</dd></div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </dl>
              </div>

              {%- comment -%}
                "Wanneer betaalt u wat?" (2026-10-29, docs/overzicht-cost-card-timeline-2026-10-29.md): the
                breakdown's own figures laid out in time, nothing new computed. Vandaag is today_cents, with
                the Huren subtotal (the prepaid months) and the Kopen subtotal (one-off) under it. Months 1
                to zv_promo_months cost nothing more (prepaid); from the month after, the customer pays
                true_month_cents, the same figure as "Daarna". Without a "Daarna" figure the month steps go.
                Only a cart where nothing recurs (no Huren line and no bought package, whose service fee
                Odoo bills monthly) says there are no monthly costs; any other cart without a "Daarna"
                figure (a bought package, or only Huren lines that "Daarna" leaves out, see
                unresolved.ODOO_ADDON_BILLING) shows the Vandaag step alone.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <section class="ovtimeline" aria-labelledby="ovtimeline-title">
                <h3 class="ovtimeline-title" id="ovtimeline-title">Wanneer betaalt u wat?</h3>
                <ol class="ovtimeline-steps">
                  <li class="ovtimeline-step ovtimeline-step--today">
                    <span class="ovtimeline-label">Vandaag</span>
                    <span class="ovtimeline-amt">{{ today_cents | money }}</span>
                    {%- if cg_huren_cents > 0 or cg_kopen_cents > 0 -%}
                      <dl class="ovtimeline-parts">
                        {%- if cg_huren_cents > 0 -%}<div><dt>{{ zv_promo_months }} maanden vooruit</dt><dd>{{ cg_huren_cents | money }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
                        {%- if cg_kopen_cents > 0 -%}<div><dt>Eenmalige kosten</dt><dd>{{ cg_kopen_cents | money }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
                      </dl>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </li>
                  {%- if true_month_cents > 0 -%}
                    <li class="ovtimeline-step ovtimeline-step--prepaid">
                      <span class="ovtimeline-label">Maand 1 t/m {{ zv_promo_months }}</span>
                      <span class="ovtimeline-amt ovtimeline-amt--sm">{{ 0 | money }} <small>— al vooruitbetaald</small></span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="ovtimeline-step ovtimeline-step--monthly">
                      <span class="ovtimeline-label">Vanaf maand {{ zv_promo_months | plus: 1 }}</span>
                      <span class="ovtimeline-amt ovtimeline-amt--md">{{ true_month_cents | money }} <small>per maand</small></span>
                      <span class="ovtimeline-sub">Automatisch via SEPA-incasso</span>
                    </li>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </ol>
                {%- if true_month_cents == 0 and cg_huren_keys == '|' and distinct_koop_fks == '' -%}
                  <p class="ovtimeline-note">Eenmalige betaling — geen maandelijkse kosten</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </section>

              {%- if pkg_available -%}
                <div class="ovblock">
                  <span class="ovblock-eb">Contract</span>
                  <p>Looptijd {{ pkg_term }} maanden. Indicatieve totale contractwaarde, inclusief eenmalige kosten: <b>{{ pkg_icv }}</b>.</p>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if pkg_line_item != nil and section.settings.before_explainer != blank -%}<p class="ovcost-note">{{ section.settings.before_explainer | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}

              <dl class="ovdl">
                <div><dt>Maandelijkse betaling</dt><dd>SEPA-incasso</dd></div>
                {%- unless koop_only -%}<div><dt>Opzeggen</dt><dd>Maandelijks, na afloop van de contractduur</dd></div>{%- endunless -%}
                <div><dt>Bedenktijd</dt><dd>14 dagen (<a href="{{ herroeping_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Herroepen</a>)</dd></div>
                {%- if show_nami_install -%}
                  <div>
                    <dt>Installatie</dt>
                    <dd>
                      {%- if selected_nami_install_id == 'geen' -%}
                        {{ zv_nami_install_geen_label }} · {{ zv_nami_install_geen_display }}
                      {%- elsif selected_nami_install_id == 'telefonisch' -%}
                        {{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_label }} · {{ zv_nami_install_telefonisch_display }}
                      {%- elsif selected_nami_install_id == 'huis' -%}
                        {{ zv_nami_install_huis_label }} · {{ zv_nami_install_huis_display }}
                      {%- else -%}
                        Kies uw installatie hiernaast
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                {%- else -%}
                  <div><dt>Installatie</dt><dd>Binnen 14 dagen, op afspraak</dd></div>
                {%- endif -%}
              </dl>

              <div class="ovdelivery">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M14 10h4l3 3v3h-7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="18" r="1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
                {%- if show_nami_install and selected_nami_install_id == 'geen' -%}
                  <p>Uw pakket wordt na uw bestelling bij u thuisbezorgd.</p>
                {%- elsif show_nami_install and selected_nami_install_id == 'telefonisch' -%}
                  <p>Uw pakket wordt bezorgd. Onze klantenservice belt u om de installatie telefonisch te begeleiden.</p>
                {%- else -%}
                  <p>Onze monteur neemt na uw bestelling contact op om de installatie in te plannen.</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ovtrust">
              <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="10" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>Beveiligde betaling</span>
              <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.4-3 8.2-7 9.5C8 19.2 5 15.4 5 11V6l7-3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>SSL-versleuteld</span>
              {%- if pkg_available and pkg_meldkamer -%}
                <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h3l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L14 14l5 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A15 15 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Securitas-meldkamer</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12l5 5 11-11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>14 dagen retour</span>
            </div>

            <div class="ovcard ovconsent">
              {%- if cart_pkg_undiscounted or cart_woning_bad or cart_koop_bad -%}
                <div class="ovconsent-err" data-ov-needs-activation role="alert">Er ging iets mis met uw bestelling. Neem contact op via 088 122 11 11.</div>
              {%- elsif cart_needs_activation -%}
                <div class="ovconsent-err" data-ov-needs-activation role="alert">Er ontbreekt een onderdeel van uw bestelling (activatie en installatie). We herstellen dit automatisch — ververs de pagina als dit blijft staan.</div>
              {%- elsif cart_needs_fix -%}
                <div class="ovconsent-err" data-ov-needs-activation role="alert">We werken uw bestelling bij. Ververs de pagina als dit blijft staan.</div>
              {%- endif -%}
              <label class="ovcheck">
                <input type="checkbox" id="ovAvConsent">
                <span>{{ consent_html }}</span>
              </label>
              <div class="ovconsent-err" data-ov-err hidden></div>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--gold ovcta" id="ovCheckoutBtn" disabled aria-disabled="true">
                {{ section.settings.checkout_button_label | default: 'Verder naar veilig afrekenen' | escape }}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </button>
              {%- if section.settings.closing_text != blank -%}<p class="ovclosing">{{ section.settings.closing_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
              <a class="btn btn--ghost ovback2" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">{{ section.settings.continue_shopping_label | default: '← Verder winkelen' | escape }}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.querySelector('[data-zv-overzicht]');
    if (!root) return;

    if (root.hasAttribute('data-cart-empty')) {
      window.location.replace('{{ routes.cart_url }}');
      return;
    }

    var checkbox = root.querySelector('#ovAvConsent');
    var btn = root.querySelector('#ovCheckoutBtn');
    var err = root.querySelector('[data-ov-err]');
    if (!checkbox || !btn) return;

    // Fail-safe: while the section's Liquid sees a cart that may not go to checkout
    // (cart_checkout_blocked: a missing installation line, a package or installation
    // quantity or stray Climax line zv-cart-guard is still fixing, or a package line
    // without its 50% discount), the checkout button stays disabled no matter what the
    // consent checkbox does - in the meantime, or if the guard's fix fails (offline, JS
    // disabled elsewhere).
    var needsActivation = root.hasAttribute('data-needs-activation');

    // Nami installation choice: swap the cart's install-fee line to match the selected
    // radio, then reload so every server-computed figure (Vandaag te betalen, the
    // indicative contract value, cart_needs_activation) reflects the real live cart -
    // same reload-after-fix pattern zv-cart-guard already uses, rather than duplicating
    // that arithmetic and Shopify's money formatting client-side.
    var installOptions = root.querySelector('[data-ov-install-options]');
    var installErr = root.querySelector('[data-ov-install-err]');
    if (installOptions) {
      var installRadios = Array.prototype.slice.call(installOptions.querySelectorAll('input[type="radio"]'));
      var FEE_VARIANT_IDS = [
        {{ activation_variant_id | json }},
        {{ nami_install_geen_variant_id | json }},
        {{ nami_install_telefonisch_variant_id | json }},
        {{ nami_install_huis_variant_id | json }}
      ].filter(function (id) { return id != null; }).map(String);

      installRadios.forEach(function (radio) {
        radio.addEventListener('change', function () {
          if (!radio.checked) return;
          var targetId = radio.getAttribute('data-install-variant-id');
          if (!targetId) return;
          installRadios.forEach(function (r) { r.disabled = true; });
          if (installErr) installErr.hidden = true;

          // Remove every other fee-type line first (swap, not stack) - covers the 2
          // other nami options AND a stray activation-fee line, in one request.
          var updates = {};
          FEE_VARIANT_IDS.forEach(function (id) {
            if (id !== String(targetId)) updates[id] = 0;
          });

          window.fetch('/cart/update.js', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ updates: updates })
          })
            .then(function (res) {
              if (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status);
              return window.fetch('/cart/add.js', {
                method: 'POST',
                headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: targetId, quantity: 1 }] })
              });
            })
            .then(function (res) {
              if (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status);
              window.location.reload();
            })
            .catch(function () {
              installRadios.forEach(function (r) { r.disabled = false; });
              if (installErr) installErr.hidden = false;
            });
        });
      });
    }

    // Re-check on click, right before leaving for Shopify's checkout. This page and its
    // server-side gate show the cart as it was at render time; another tab, the drawer or a
    // restored (bfcache) page can have changed it since. Fetch /cart.js again: if its lines
    // differ from the ones rendered here (data-cart-sig, line key:quantity) or the cart
    // guard's own rules (window.zvCartGuard.planFix) find something to fix, reload Overzicht
    // so the guard and the gate run on the real cart, instead of navigating. Without the
    // guard (it renders nothing when zv_promo_package_qty is 0) only the signature is checked.
    function sigOf(parts) { return parts.filter(Boolean).sort().join(','); }
    var renderedSig = sigOf((root.getAttribute('data-cart-sig') || '').split(','));
    function freshCartNeedsReload(cart) {
      var items = (cart && cart.items) || [];
      var sig = sigOf(items.map(function (it) { return it.key + ':' + it.quantity; }));
      if (sig !== renderedSig) return true;
      var guard = window.zvCartGuard;
      return !!(guard && guard.planFix(cart));
    }

    // The browser can restore a ticked checkbox on reload or Back (bfcache) without firing
    // 'change', and a bfcache restore also brings back a button the click disabled. So the
    // button state is synced on load and on every pageshow, not only on change.
    function syncButton() {
      btn.disabled = needsActivation || !checkbox.checked;
      btn.setAttribute('aria-disabled', btn.disabled ? 'true' : 'false');
    }
    syncButton();
    window.addEventListener('pageshow', syncButton);

    checkbox.addEventListener('change', function () {
      syncButton();
      if (checkbox.checked && err) err.hidden = true;
    });

    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      if (btn.disabled || needsActivation) return;
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.setAttribute('aria-disabled', 'true');
      if (err) err.hidden = true;
      window.fetch('/cart.js', { cache: 'no-store' })
        .then(function (res) { if (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status); return res.json(); })
        .then(function (cart) {
          if (freshCartNeedsReload(cart)) { window.location.reload(); return; }
          return window.fetch('/cart/update.js', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({
              attributes: {
                av_akkoord: 'ja',
                av_akkoord_tijdstip: new Date().toISOString()
              }
            })
          })
            .then(function (res) { if (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status); return res.json(); })
            .then(function () { window.location.href = '/checkout'; });
        })
        .catch(function () {
          if (err) { err.hidden = false; err.textContent = 'Er ging iets mis. Probeer het opnieuw.'; }
          btn.disabled = false;
          btn.setAttribute('aria-disabled', 'false');
        });
    });
  })();
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
.zv-overzicht {
  --ink:#1a1230; --indigo:#322469; --indigo-soft:#ece8fb; --paper:#fffdf8; --cream:#fdfaf2;
  --gold:#e4a311; --gold-lt:#f5c84a; --belt:#9c6c08; --line:#e7e0cf; --line-2:#ddd4c0;
  --muted:#6f6786; --muted-2:#8c84a6;
  color:var(--ink); line-height:1.5; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf5e9,#f4ecda);
}
.zv-overzicht .wrap { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 clamp(20px,3.6vw,52px); }
.zv-overzicht .ovbar { background:var(--paper); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding:22px 0 18px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovbar-top { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.zv-overzicht .ovbar h1 { font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px); font-weight:900; color:var(--indigo); letter-spacing:-.02em; }
.zv-overzicht .ovback { margin-left:auto; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--indigo); text-decoration:none; }
.zv-overzicht .ovback svg { width:16px; height:16px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovsub { margin-top:6px; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; color:#5b5374; max-width:60ch; }
.zv-overzicht .ovsteps { list-style:none; display:flex; gap:22px; margin-top:18px; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:0; }
.zv-overzicht .ovsteps li { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--muted); }
.zv-overzicht .ovsteps .n { width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--indigo-soft); color:var(--indigo); display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:13px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovsteps .n svg { width:14px; height:14px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovsteps li.active { color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovsteps li.active .n { background:var(--gold); color:#3a2a06; }
.zv-overzicht .ovsteps li.done .n { background:var(--indigo); color:#fff; }
.zv-overzicht .ovnoscript { padding:16px 0; font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); }
.zv-overzicht .ovwrap { padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px) 0 90px; }
.zv-overzicht .olayout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr; gap:26px; align-items:start; }
.zv-overzicht .ov-left, .zv-overzicht .ov-right { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px; }
@media(max-width:920px){
  .zv-overzicht .olayout { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .zv-overzicht .ov-right { order:1; }
  .zv-overzicht .ov-left { order:2; }
}
.zv-overzicht .ovcard { background:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px; padding:24px; box-shadow:0 22px 52px -44px rgba(26,18,48,.5); }
.zv-overzicht .ovcard h2 { font-size:18px; font-weight:900; color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovcard-head { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:8px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovedit { margin-left:auto; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--indigo); text-decoration:none; }
.zv-overzicht .ovitems { display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
.zv-overzicht .ovitem { display:grid; grid-template-columns:64px 1fr auto; gap:16px; padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); align-items:center; }
.zv-overzicht .ovitem:last-child { border-bottom:none; padding-bottom:0; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-thumb { width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--indigo-soft); color:var(--indigo); display:grid; place-items:center; overflow:hidden; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-thumb svg { width:32px; height:32px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-thumb img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-line { font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--belt); }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-name { font-size:16.5px; font-weight:900; color:var(--indigo); margin-top:2px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-meta { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted); margin-top:4px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-right { text-align:right; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-price { font-size:17px; font-weight:900; color:var(--ink); white-space:nowrap; }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-price span { font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); }
.zv-overzicht .ovi-right .ovi-meta { max-width:230px; margin-left:auto; }
.zv-overzicht .ovgroup + .ovgroup { margin-top:20px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovg-head { margin:0 0 2px; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--belt); }
.zv-overzicht .ovg-sub { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:12px 0 0; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#5b5374; }
.zv-overzicht .ovg-sub b { font-weight:800; color:var(--ink); }
.zv-overzicht .ovdl { margin-top:12px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovdl > div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#5b5374; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
.zv-overzicht .ovdl > div:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
.zv-overzicht .ovdl dt { font-weight:600; }
.zv-overzicht .ovdl dd { font-weight:800; color:var(--ink); text-align:right; }
.zv-overzicht .ovdl dd.strong { font-size:18px; color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovbreakdown > div.ovbreakdown-total { border-top:1.5px solid var(--line-2); border-bottom:none; padding-top:12px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovbreakdown > div.ovbreakdown-total dt { font-weight:800; color:var(--ink); }
.zv-overzicht .ovbreakdown-group { margin-top:16px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovbreakdown-group .ovdl { margin:2px 0 0; }
.zv-overzicht .ovbreakdown > div.ovbreakdown-sub dt { font-weight:800; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-section { margin-top:20px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-section > .ovi-line { display:block; margin-bottom:12px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-options { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-opt { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 64px 1fr auto; gap:16px; align-items:center; padding:16px; border:1.5px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:16px; cursor:pointer; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-opt:has(input:checked) { border-color:var(--indigo); background:var(--indigo-soft); }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-opt:has(input:checked) .ovinstall-icon { background:var(--indigo); color:#fff; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-opt input { width:22px; height:22px; flex:none; accent-color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-opt input:disabled { opacity:.6; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-icon { width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--indigo-soft); color:var(--indigo); display:grid; place-items:center; flex:none; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-icon svg { width:30px; height:30px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-title { font-size:16px; font-weight:900; color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-price { font-size:16px; font-weight:900; color:var(--ink); white-space:nowrap; }
.zv-overzicht .ovinstall-err { margin-top:10px; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:#c52e2f; }
@media(max-width:480px){
  .zv-overzicht .ovinstall-opt { grid-template-columns:auto 52px 1fr; row-gap:6px; }
  .zv-overzicht .ovinstall-icon { width:52px; height:52px; }
  .zv-overzicht .ovinstall-icon svg { width:24px; height:24px; }
  .zv-overzicht .ovinstall-price { grid-column:2 / 4; font-size:14px; }
}
.zv-overzicht .ovexplain { margin-top:16px; display:flex; gap:11px; padding:14px 16px; background:var(--cream); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovexplain svg { flex:none; width:20px; height:20px; color:var(--indigo); margin-top:1px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovexplain p { font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5; }
.zv-overzicht .ovcost-sub { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; color:#5b5374; margin-top:4px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovblock { margin-top:18px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
.zv-overzicht .ovblock:first-of-type { margin-top:14px; padding-top:0; border-top:none; }
.zv-overzicht .ovblock-eb { display:block; font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--belt); margin-bottom:6px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovblock p { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; color:#5b5374; line-height:1.5; }
.zv-overzicht .ovblock-amt { font-size:28px; font-weight:900; color:var(--indigo); margin-top:6px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovcost-note { font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5; margin-top:16px; padding-top:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline { margin-top:18px; padding:22px 22px 20px; border-radius:16px; background:var(--indigo); color:var(--cream); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-title { margin:0 0 16px; font-size:17px; font-weight:900; line-height:1.3; letter-spacing:0; color:var(--cream); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-steps { list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-step { position:relative; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px; padding:0 0 20px 28px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-step:last-child { padding-bottom:0; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-step::before { content:''; position:absolute; left:0; top:3px; width:14px; height:14px; box-sizing:border-box; border-radius:50%; border:2px solid var(--gold); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-step--today::before { background:var(--gold); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-step--monthly::before { border-color:var(--cream); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-step::after { content:''; position:absolute; left:6px; top:21px; bottom:0; width:2px; background:var(--indigo-soft); opacity:.3; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-step:last-child::after { content:none; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-label { font-size:12px; font-weight:900; line-height:20px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold-lt); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-amt { font-size:30px; font-weight:900; line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:-.01em; color:var(--cream); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-amt small { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0; color:var(--indigo-soft); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-amt--sm { font-size:20px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-amt--md { font-size:24px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-parts { margin:6px 0 0; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-parts > div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:2px 0; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; color:var(--indigo-soft); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-parts dt, .zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-parts dd { margin:0; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-parts dd { font-weight:800; white-space:nowrap; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-sub { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--indigo-soft); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-note { margin:14px 0 0; padding-left:28px; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.4; color:var(--indigo-soft); }
@media(max-width:480px){
  .zv-overzicht .ovtimeline { padding:18px 16px; }
  .zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-amt { font-size:26px; }
  .zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-amt--sm { font-size:18px; }
  .zv-overzicht .ovtimeline-amt--md { font-size:22px; }
}
.zv-overzicht .ovdelivery { margin-top:16px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; gap:11px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovdelivery svg { flex:none; width:22px; height:22px; color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovdelivery p { font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtrust { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px 18px; padding:16px 4px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovtrust span { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted-2); }
.zv-overzicht .ovtrust svg { width:15px; height:15px; color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovcheck { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:11px; cursor:pointer; }
.zv-overzicht .ovcheck input { width:19px; height:19px; margin-top:2px; flex:none; accent-color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-overzicht .ovcheck span { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; color:#5b5374; line-height:1.5; }
.zv-overzicht .ovcheck a { color:var(--indigo); font-weight:800; }
.zv-overzicht .ovconsent-err { margin-top:8px; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:#c52e2f; }
.zv-overzicht .btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:9px; border:none; cursor:pointer; border-radius:12px; font:inherit; font-weight:800; text-decoration:none; padding:14px 24px; width:100%; }
.zv-overzicht .btn svg { width:18px; height:18px; }
.zv-overzicht .btn--gold { background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gold-lt),var(--gold)); color:#3a2a06; box-shadow:0 14px 30px -18px rgba(228,163,17,.9); }
.zv-overzicht .btn--gold:disabled { opacity:.5; cursor:not-allowed; box-shadow:none; }
.zv-overzicht .btn--ghost { background:transparent; color:var(--indigo); border:1.5px solid var(--line); }
.zv-overzicht .ovcta { margin-top:16px; }
.zv-overzicht .ovclosing { font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5; margin-top:14px; text-align:center; }
.zv-overzicht .ovback2 { margin-top:10px; }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Overzicht (checkout)",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "sub_type", "label": "Abonnement-producttype", "default": "Beveiligingsabonnement", "info": "Moet overeenkomen met het producttype dat zv-cart.liquid gebruikt." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sub_tag", "label": "Abonnement-producttag (fallback)", "default": "abonnement", "info": "Moet overeenkomen met de fallback-tag die zv-cart.liquid gebruikt." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Titel", "default": "Overzicht" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "subheading", "label": "Subtitel", "default": "Controleer uw keuze voordat u veilig afrekent. U kunt dit hieronder nog wijzigen." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pkg_card_heading", "label": "Kop · pakketkaart", "default": "Uw pakket en configuratie" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pkg_card_link_label", "label": "Link · pakketkaart", "default": "Wijzig in winkelwagen" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "before_explainer", "label": "Toelichting · promo", "default": "De eerste 3 maanden van uw pakket betaalt u vandaag vooruit, met 50% korting, samen met de eventuele installatiekosten. Daarna betaalt u het vaste maandbedrag via SEPA-incasso. Alle bedragen zijn inclusief btw (21%)." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cost_card_heading", "label": "Kop · kostenkaart", "default": "Uw kosten in het kort" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "cost_card_sub", "label": "Subtitel · kostenkaart", "default": "Alles wat u vastlegt, in het kort. Zo weet u precies waar u aan toe bent." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "due_today_text", "label": "Toelichting · vandaag te betalen", "default": "Vandaag betaalt u de eventuele installatiekosten en de eerste 3 maanden van uw pakket vooruit, met 50% korting, via onze beveiligde betaalomgeving." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "consent_prefix", "label": "Akkoordtekst · voor de link", "default": "Ik ga akkoord met de", "info": "Gevolgd door een vaste link naar de Algemene Voorwaarden." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "consent_middle", "label": "Akkoordtekst · na de link (met pakket)", "default": ", de contractduur van", "info": "Gevolgd door de contractduur van het pakket, in maanden." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "consent_suffix", "label": "Akkoordtekst · slot", "default": "en de betaalplicht." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "checkout_button_label", "label": "Knoptekst · afrekenen", "default": "Verder naar veilig afrekenen" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "closing_text", "label": "Slotzin", "default": "U rondt uw betaling van vandaag veilig af in onze beveiligde betaalomgeving." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "continue_shopping_label", "label": "Knoptekst · verder winkelen", "default": "← Verder winkelen" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
